@@ -5,7 +5,7 @@
   {
    "id": 0,
    "role_zh": "前排破盾手",
-   "role_en": "Front-line shield breaker",
+   "role_en": "Front shield breaker",
    "story_zh": "王國裡最準時上下班的模範步兵。頭盔上的小藍羽是媽媽縫的，短劍磨得亮晶晶。最喜歡找舉大盾的傢伙比力氣；背後有黑影靠近時，也會毫不猶豫轉身回一劍。",
    "story_en": "The kingdom's most punctual foot soldier. Mom sewed the little blue plume on the helmet; the short sword is polished to a shine. Loves testing strength against big shields — and spins around the moment a shadow creeps up behind.",
    "tagline_zh": "我先上，點心留一份！",
@@ -36,7 +36,7 @@
   {
    "id": 1,
    "role_zh": "前排肉盾、反騎兵",
-   "role_en": "Front-line wall, anti-cavalry",
+   "role_en": "Front wall, anti-cavalry",
    "story_zh": "原本是城門口的守衛大叔，因為力氣太大總把門把拽壞，乾脆拆了一塊厚鐵板當盾。雖然走得慢吞吞，但只要把盾往地上一插，連狂奔的小馬都會撞得眼冒金星。",
    "story_en": "Used to guard the city gate, but kept ripping off door handles — so now carries a slab of iron as a shield. Slow on foot, but plant that shield and even a galloping pony sees stars.",
    "tagline_zh": "靠過來，這邊有位子！",
@@ -100,7 +100,7 @@
   {
    "id": 3,
    "role_zh": "側翼突擊、獵弓手",
-   "role_en": "Flank raider, archer hunter",
+   "role_en": "Flanker, hunts archers",
    "story_zh": "金色蘑菇頭配上一匹脾氣倔強的小馬。最討厭正面排隊，總愛沿著邊邊繞去後排找弓箭手。直直跑起來就停不下來，唯獨看到大盾牌會雙腿發軟。",
    "story_en": "A golden mushroom haircut on a stubborn little pony. Hates waiting in line up front and loves sneaking around the edge to find archers. Once running straight there's no stopping — except at the sight of a big shield.",
    "tagline_zh": "坐穩，我們繞一下！",
@@ -132,7 +132,7 @@
   {
    "id": 4,
    "role_zh": "潛入、獵重甲",
-   "role_en": "Infiltrator, armor hunter",
+   "role_en": "Sneaks in, hunts armor",
    "story_zh": "把紫色大兜帽拉得低低的害羞小個子，怕生所以開戰時會先憋氣隱形。最擅長偷偷繞到盾兵背後戳一下，或綁繩子絆倒小馬；被發現時會臉紅到忘記閃躲。",
    "story_en": "A shy little one with a big purple hood pulled low — so shy they hold their breath and vanish when battle starts. Expert at poking shields from behind and tripping ponies; when spotted, they blush so hard they forget to dodge.",
    "tagline_zh": "借過一下，嘿嘿。",
@@ -164,7 +164,7 @@
   {
    "id": 5,
    "role_zh": "第二排長柄、拒騎",
-   "role_en": "Second-rank pike, anti-cavalry",
+   "role_en": "Pike line, anti-cavalry",
    "story_zh": "村裡個子最高的孩子，偏偏最怕站第一排。銅色的扁鍋盔是外婆的湯鍋改的，長槍尖綁著紅纓，躲在盾牌哥哥後面也能戳到前面的人。看到小馬衝過來，會把槍尾往地上一頓——「停！」",
    "story_en": "The tallest kid in the village, and the most nervous about the front row. The copper pot-helmet used to be Grandma's soup pot; the red tassel on the pike lets everyone know where the poke is coming from. Hiding behind a big shield, it can still reach the front. When a pony charges in, it plants the butt of the pike — \"Stop!\"",
    "tagline_zh": "我在後面，但我搆得到！",
@@ -196,7 +196,7 @@
   {
    "id": 6,
    "role_zh": "後排範圍轟炸、拆盾牆",
-   "role_en": "Back-line area bomber, wall breaker",
+   "role_en": "Bomber, breaks walls",
    "story_zh": "戴著黃銅大護目鏡、圍著橘紅頭巾的發明家。肩上永遠扛著一顆冒小火花的圓滾滾火罐，最喜歡看擠成一團的盾牌一起跳起來。敵人一靠近就慌了，只會拿點火棒亂敲。",
    "story_en": "An inventor in big brass goggles and an orange bandana, always shouldering a round pot with a fizzing fuse. Loves watching a packed shield wall hop all at once. Gets flustered the moment anyone comes close — then it's just frantic bonking with the lighter stick.",
    "tagline_zh": "大家站好——不要動喔！",
@@ -227,7 +227,7 @@
   {
    "id": 7,
    "role_zh": "後排補血、撐住前排",
-   "role_en": "Back-line healer, keeps the front alive",
+   "role_en": "Heals the front line",
    "story_zh": "戴著印了綠十字的白色高帽，手上的長杖頂端會發綠光。戰場上它一刀也不揮，眼睛只盯著誰的血最少，跟在後面一路小跑。隊友都走光了，才會氣呼呼地拿杖子敲人。",
    "story_en": "A tall white hat with a green cross and a staff whose tip glows green. It never swings at anyone — its eyes are only on whoever's lowest, trotting along behind them. Only when the whole team is gone does it angrily bonk someone with the staff.",
    "tagline_zh": "誰受傷了？舉手！",
@@ -258,7 +258,7 @@
   {
    "id": 8,
    "role_zh": "陣型中心、全隊加速",
-   "role_en": "Formation center, team-wide tempo",
+   "role_en": "Center, speeds the team",
    "story_zh": "羽毛帽是全軍最高的，胸前掛著比自己還圓的大鼓。咚、咚、咚——鼓聲一響，旁邊的人手腳都跟著快起來。它自己不打架，只負責讓大家打得更起勁。",
    "story_en": "The tallest feathered hat in the army and a drum rounder than itself. Boom, boom, boom — when it plays, everyone nearby moves a little faster. It doesn't fight; it just makes everyone fight harder.",
    "tagline_zh": "跟著節拍——上！",
@@ -288,7 +288,7 @@
   {
    "id": 9,
    "role_zh": "破陣開路",
-   "role_en": "Wall breaker, opens the way",
+   "role_en": "Breaks walls open",
    "story_zh": "一頭火紅刺蝟頭、披著毛茸茸的獸皮，左右手各一把大斧。它不在乎自己砍了多少，只要把對面的大盾劈出裂縫，後面的弓箭手和劍士就能一擁而上。被小馬撞到也紋風不動。",
    "story_en": "A fiery spiky head, a fluffy pelt and a big axe in each hand. It doesn't care how much damage it does — it just splits the enemy's shields so the archers and swords behind can pour in. Even a charging pony can't budge it.",
    "tagline_zh": "盾牌？借我看一下。",
@@ -320,7 +320,7 @@
   {
    "id": 10,
    "role_zh": "不會動的毒圈封路",
-   "role_en": "Stationary poison roadblock",
+   "role_en": "Poison roadblock",
    "story_zh": "住在森林裡的蘑菇，被傭兵公會的傳單騙來當兵。它不會走路，也懶得走路，只要有人踩進它的地盤，就噗地噴一口孢子。隊友都說它是全軍最穩的同事，因為它真的不會動。",
    "story_en": "A forest mushroom lured in by a guild flyer. It can't walk and wouldn't want to. Step on its turf and it puffs out spores. Teammates call it the steadiest soldier around, because it truly never moves.",
    "tagline_zh": "別踩我的草皮",
@@ -410,7 +410,7 @@
   {
    "id": 13,
    "role_zh": "打不完的前排",
-   "role_en": "The front line that keeps coming",
+   "role_en": "Endless front line",
    "story_zh": "一團黏黏的東西，對任何事都很樂觀。被砍成兩半時它會說「太好了，多一個朋友」。小史萊姆長大後會忘記對方，然後在下一場互相打招呼。",
    "story_en": "A cheerful blob, optimistic about everything. Cut in half, it says, \"Great, one more friend.\" The slimelets forget each other and say hello again next battle.",
    "tagline_zh": "我們是一夥的，也是兩夥的",
@@ -440,7 +440,7 @@
   {
    "id": 14,
    "role_zh": "穿牆獵殺後排",
-   "role_en": "Back-line hunter through walls",
+   "role_en": "Hunts the back line",
    "story_zh": "它不記得自己怎麼死的，只記得還有東西沒吃完。穿過前排時它會小聲說「借過」，然後直直飄到弓箭手面前，弓箭手通常會射它，箭會穿過去，弓箭手通常會哭。",
    "story_en": "It can't recall how it died, only that it left a snack unfinished. Slipping through the front line, it whispers \"excuse me,\" drifts up to the archer, gets shot, the arrow passes through, and the archer usually cries.",
    "tagline_zh": "借過，我趕時間",
@@ -500,7 +500,7 @@
   {
    "id": 16,
    "role_zh": "關鍵時刻的時停",
-   "role_en": "Time stop at the clutch moment",
+   "role_en": "Clutch time stop",
    "story_zh": "一隻從時鐘店逃出來的小精靈，沙子流完就會打瞌睡。隊友快撐不住的時候，它會用力敲一下自己的玻璃，全場安靜兩秒半。它覺得兩秒半夠長了，反正大家都很急。",
    "story_en": "A little sprite that fled a clock shop and nods off when the sand runs out. When allies are failing, it knocks on its own glass and everything goes quiet for two and a half seconds. It thinks two and a half seconds is plenty, since everyone's always in a hurry.",
    "tagline_zh": "再等兩秒",
--- a/game/tests/run_tests.gd
+++ b/game/tests/run_tests.gd
@@ -2,7 +2,7 @@
 ## 測試入口（第七輪 I1 拆檔）：`godot --headless --path . --script res://tests/run_tests.gd [-- --only=<測試組>]`。
 ## 一律「至少 1 項通過且 0 失敗」才 exit 0（R2）；未知的測試組直接失敗。
 ## 測試組＝tests/suites/ 的檔名，另外 new＝units。
